WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.968
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
It is great to meet you.

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:05.434
-Yeah. Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.267
This is weird.

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:08.901
-I want to know your story.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:10.033
I want to know everything
about you

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.501
because I know you now
from "Ms. Marvel."

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:17.067
But this is your first acting
gig straight out of high school.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:19.167
-Hell yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.501
-How does it happen?
And I love that it happened.

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:22.734
And I love that it happened
to you.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:23.968
But explain to everyone.

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.901
You got a -- Was it --
-WhatsApp.

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.300
-You got a WhatsApp.
-WhatsApp.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.734
I got a WhatsApp.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:33.033
My aunt forwarded me a WhatsApp
of the casting call.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.834
Super sketchy.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.501
I don't know what casting calls
look like.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.100
But I'm, like, obsessed with
Marvel,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.234
Obsessed with Ms. Marvel, read
all the comics in high school.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:41.567
Dressed up as her on Halloween.

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:43.167
-This is you on Halloween,
by the way.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:44.234
-Yeah.

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:45.501
[ Audience awws ]

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:46.968
-So, I mean, this is
unbelievable that

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:48.834
it's actually real
and happening.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:49.834
-Yeah.
[ Applause ]

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:51.400
-I mean, it's crazy. How cool.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.868
And I love your aunt,
by the way.

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:54.467
And sent you this thing.
And this is it.

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.334
Casting search for "Ms. Marvel."

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:57.834
-Is that not a scam?

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.667
-I mean, it looks -- Yeah.

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:01.701
That kind of could
easily be fake.

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:03.133
-Totally.
-But it wasn't.

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.400
-No. I sent
in a very academic résumé

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.334
and the only headshot I had.

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:10.734
I was like, "I did 30 hours of
community service and --"

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:13.133
Because that's what
gets you roles.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.801
Yeah, and I sent them
my self-tape at like 3:00 a.m.

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:16.968
Wasn't going to do it.

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:18.234
And then the next day,
I get a call.

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:19.167
They're like,
"Do you have a lawyer?

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.334
We want to fly you to L.A."

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:22.100
And I was like,
"I have a math test.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.133
But can we like --
We'll figure this out. Okay."

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:26.133
[ Laughter ]
-Do you have a lawyer? Really?

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.601
Wow, that's official, yeah.

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:30.234
-They, like, do all this stuff
before you even get the part.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.667
-Did you know that you had
a chance at getting the part?

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:35.434
Can you feel it when you're
auditioning or you're like, no?

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:37.467
-I mean, now that I have it,
I can say it, but...

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:38.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:42.634
-But also your character is
a big fan of the Avengers,

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:45.100
and so are you in real life.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.801
You know comics.
You know Marvel.

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:47.968
-I know everything.

00:01:47.968 --> 00:01:50.701
I used to, like, make little
Avengers nail art

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:52.234
before the movies
would come out.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.267
-Wow.
-Very active on all

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.434
the reddit forums, still am.

00:01:55.434 --> 00:01:57.601
-Yeah, you said you would,
like, pause the trailers

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.667
at different frames and try to
guess what's happening.

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:02.067
-I used to give my parents
presentations before the movies

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:04.033
came out so that they were
on track with everything

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:05.634
when the new ones came out,
yeah.

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:09.267
-This could not happen to
a better person.

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:13.300
And then we actually have
a video of when they told you --

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.968
-I'd like to say
I did not have consent.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.834
They did not tell me
they were recording that.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:19.801
It was a Kevin Feige jump-scare
on my phone.

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:23.934
Like, he's my third favorite
person on the planet.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.367
You're up there.
-Okay, thank you.

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:27.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:29.400
Wait, so, Kevin Feige --
You don't even know --

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.868
-It's Robert Downey Jr.,
Billy Joel, Kevin Feige.

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.567
No one takes up that little
space except, like --

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:38.434
-Robert Downey Jr., Billy Joel,
Kevin Feige.

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:39.901
-Yeah.

00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.200
-Me?
-Yeah.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.701
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:44.467
-It is now.
-I'll take number four, yeah.

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:46.934
-Great.
-I'll take number four, yeah.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.000
♪ Some folks like to get away ♪

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.734
-First talk show,
I've already offended --

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:56.234
-♪ Take a holiday
from the neighborhood ♪

00:02:56.234 --> 00:03:00.100
♪ Hop a flight to Miami Beach ♪

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.100
-Be still my --
-Thank you.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.501
So I'm up the list?
-Yeah.

00:03:03.501 --> 00:03:06.334
-Alright, perfect. Thank you.
Billy, watch out.

00:03:06.334 --> 00:03:08.534
But we have video
of the Zoom call.

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:11.400
Here's Iman finding out that
she was cast as Ms. Marvel.

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:28.601 --> 00:03:30.667
But him just coming on is cool.

00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:32.067
Right?
-Yeah.

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:35.334
Kevin Feige on my phone was
bigger than me getting the part.

00:03:35.334 --> 00:03:36.834
-Just him coming on your phone?
-Yeah.

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:37.968
-"What is going on right now?"

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:39.067
Even if you didn't get it,
you're like,

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:40.234
"This is just worth it for me."

00:03:40.234 --> 00:03:42.234
-Yeah, I was literally
on my friend's driveway.

00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:44.501
It was the last day of school.
We were gonna get burritos.

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:45.834
And then this happened.

00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:48.634
-That's just unbelievable.
I love this story so much.

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:52.234
And now that you're in the MCU,

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:55.534
do you know secrets and stuff
that we don't know?

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:56.634
-I know secrets.
-Wow.

00:03:56.634 --> 00:03:57.834
-You know secrets.
-I know secrets.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:03:59.133
Well, I'd like to think
that I know secrets.

00:03:59.133 --> 00:04:00.601
I don't know how much
they're, like, humoring me,

00:04:00.601 --> 00:04:02.200
but I think I know secrets.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.634
It's like power, you know?

00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:05.133
The first time with people,
it's like money and fame.

00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:06.934
For me, it's like MCU secrets.

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:09.601
-Really? So, you know stuff.
-I'm set. Yeah.

00:04:09.601 --> 00:04:12.667
-Like, can you tell me a secret
that you knew that is out now

00:04:12.667 --> 00:04:15.767
that you couldn't tell?
-No, but, like, Tom Holland --

00:04:15.767 --> 00:04:18.200
First time I met him,
that was embarrassing.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:20.501
No, we were trying to get
this to happen

00:04:20.501 --> 00:04:23.567
'cause it was like my last day,
you know, filming in the Atlanta

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:26.067
stages before we moved on
to location.

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:29.167
And he --
I was like half dressed,

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:30.434
about to get on my super suit.

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:31.667
And they were like,
"Oh, we need you in makeup."

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:32.934
And I was like, "Okay, okay.
I'll just throw on

00:04:32.934 --> 00:04:34.667
this giant puffy jacket."

00:04:34.667 --> 00:04:37.534
And I'm in makeup
and we get a knock.

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:39.067
And they're like,
"Someone wants to meet you."

00:04:39.067 --> 00:04:40.534
And I'm like, "No!"

00:04:40.534 --> 00:04:42.767
I'm like, "Okay."
And so Tom Holland came in

00:04:42.767 --> 00:04:44.133
and I'm like this
the entire time.

00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:45.167
And he goes [British accent]

00:04:45.167 --> 00:04:46.767
"So, what's this show
even about?"

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:49.234
[ Normal voice ] And I'm like,
"Oh, what's Spider-Man about?"

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:51.033
'Cause I'm trying to be smart
with him.

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:53.167
And he fully just like shows me
a photo of, like,

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:55.400
him with Andrew Garfield
and Tobey Maguire.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.567
And I was like, "Dude!"

00:04:57.567 --> 00:04:59.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:01.100
-That's the spoiler right there.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.400
That is "the" spoiler. Wow!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.467
So then what --
Now you became best friends.

00:05:06.467 --> 00:05:07.767
-I -- I don't know.

00:05:07.767 --> 00:05:09.667
But yeah, I couldn't top that.

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:12.868
I was like, "Oh, I have --
Ours is a coming-of-age story."

00:05:12.868 --> 00:05:14.868
[ Laughter ]
"I guess."

00:05:14.868 --> 00:05:17.167
-That was your spoiler?
-That was my spoiler.

00:05:17.167 --> 00:05:20.767
-Who else did you get to -- I
know you're also in the Marvels

00:05:20.767 --> 00:05:22.734
with Brie Larson,
who's one of our pals.

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:24.267
-Yeah.
-I love Brie Larson.

00:05:24.267 --> 00:05:26.200
-I love her.
-She works hard, man.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.901
-She does.
-She is fantastic!

00:05:27.901 --> 00:05:29.000
I love her so much.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.567
So what was it like
meeting Brie?

00:05:30.567 --> 00:05:33.100
-I'm really bad at meeting
famous people.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.200
-Why?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.767
-Like Kevin Feige,
I stopped speaking.

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:38.167
Tom Hiddleston, I fell to
the ground just out of shock.

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:39.868
Tom Holland, in underwear.

00:05:39.868 --> 00:05:43.267
Brie Larson, that was a lot
better 'cause I met her

00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:47.000
over FaceTime before I got to
meet her in person.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.767
So, like, the first time we met
each other,

00:05:48.767 --> 00:05:49.934
I was like,
"Oh, my God, you're real,"

00:05:49.934 --> 00:05:51.234
and she's like,
"Oh, my God, you're real!"

00:05:51.234 --> 00:05:53.133
And we just hugged for like
a solid five minutes.

00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:54.601
It was a good hug.
-I love that.

00:05:54.601 --> 00:05:57.000
[ Audience awws ]
Can we talk about "Ms. Marvel"

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.234
and what the show is about?

00:05:58.234 --> 00:05:59.868
I know it's a coming-of-age
story about a girl

00:05:59.868 --> 00:06:01.901
dealing with getting super--
-I can do more than that. Okay.

00:06:01.901 --> 00:06:05.033
Kamala Khan, 16-year-old kid
from Jersey City.

00:06:05.033 --> 00:06:07.100
And she's obsessed with
the Avengers.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.234
Obsessed with the simplicity of
a hero's life.

00:06:10.234 --> 00:06:11.901
They fight crime.
They look cool doing it.

00:06:11.901 --> 00:06:14.167
And, you know, Captain Marvel
doesn't really have to deal with

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:17.100
boys or religion or high school
or growing pains

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.400
or culture or family drama.
The list goes on.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.334
-Of course not.
-No. So, yeah, she kind of

00:06:22.334 --> 00:06:24.801
pines for that life
and now she has super powers.

00:06:24.801 --> 00:06:28.467
So that's cool and --
-We get to see what happens.

00:06:28.467 --> 00:06:31.834
-We get to see what happens. And
she becomes this, like, badass

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:33.467
version of what a hero
can look like.

00:06:33.467 --> 00:06:35.767
-Well, it can't happen to
a better person.

00:06:35.767 --> 00:06:37.067
Congratulations on this.
-Thank you so much.

00:06:37.067 --> 00:06:39.934
-I'm so happy for -- Come back.
Continued success.

00:06:39.934 --> 00:06:41.701
-Yeah.
-Here we go.

00:06:41.701 --> 00:06:43.734
I'm going to show
everyone a clip.

00:06:43.734 --> 00:06:46.501
Here's Iman Vellani
as Ms. Marvel.

00:06:46.501 --> 00:06:47.968
Take a look.

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:55.467
♪♪

00:06:55.467 --> 00:06:57.100
-Hold on.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:03.334
♪♪

00:07:03.334 --> 00:07:05.167
-Please let me go.

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:06.701
You have to let me go.

00:07:09.133 --> 00:07:12.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.067 --> 00:07:18.334
♪♪

00:07:18.334 --> 00:07:20.133
Whoa!

00:07:20.133 --> 00:07:27.501
♪♪

00:07:27.501 --> 00:07:29.200
Yes!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.367
-Well, if that's not fun,
come on!

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:33.667
Iman Vellani, everybody!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:33.667 --> 00:07:36.634
"Ms. Marvel" premiere's tomorrow
on Disney+.

